  "body": "Auction: 8-12 The Promenade, Takapuna on Thursday 26 November 2026 at 10:00AM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nAWESOME LOCATION – EXCITING POTENTIAL – THIS PROPERTY WILL BE SOLD!\r\n\r\nTucked away in a peaceful, private setting, this classic Campbells Bay home offers an exceptional coastal lifestyle, just a short stroll to Campbells Bay Beach and moments from the cafés, restaurants and shops of Mairangi Bay Village.\r\n\r\nSet on fully fenced grounds, this light-filled home combines generous living spaces, sunny outdoor entertaining and exciting potential to add value.\r\n\r\nSPACE, SUNSHINE & POTENTIAL\r\nThe main level features two bedrooms, a spacious bathroom, separate kitchen and dining, plus a versatile sunroom. Enjoy seamless indoor-outdoor living with a generous sunny deck and beautifully landscaped backyard.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, the oversized master bedroom offers an ensuite and elevated views. Downstairs, a huge double garage provides excellent storage, workshop options or future potential, complemented by ample off-street parking.\r\n\r\nMove in and enjoy, or modernise to suit your style and unlock the possibilities.\r\n\r\nA SOUGHT-AFTER FAMILY LIFESTYLE\r\nEnjoy easy access to the beach, golf course, coastal walks, Mairangi Bay Village and the Beach Road bus route. Families will appreciate the nearby schools and sought-after school zones, including Campbells Bay Primary, Mairangi Bay School, Murrays Bay Intermediate, Rangitoto College and Westlake Boys’ and Girls’ High Schools. Please confirm enrolment eligibility with each school.\r\n\r\nYOUR COASTAL OPPORTUNITY AWAITS!\r\nPrivacy, generous outdoor living, substantial garaging and value-adding potential in a superb coastal location — opportunities like this deserve your attention.\r\n\r\nA short stroll to the beach. A fantastic lifestyle. A property ready for its next chapter.\r\n\r\nTHIS PROPERTY WILL BE SOLD! Call today to arrange your viewing.",
